WEBVTT

00:00:06.380 --> 00:00:09.370
<b>Kyou-chan, you’re already a big sister, aren’t you?</b>

00:00:06.380 --> 00:00:09.370
<b>Kyou-chan, you’re already a big sister, aren’t you?</b>

00:00:10.440 --> 00:00:11.190
<b>Yes!</b>

00:00:10.440 --> 00:00:11.190
<b>Yes!</b>

00:00:13.320 --> 00:00:16.540
<b>I’m your big sister! Do you understand me?{I wonder if she understands…}</b>

00:00:13.320 --> 00:00:16.540
<b>I’m your big sister! Do you understand me?{I wonder if she understands…}</b>

00:00:17.050 --> 00:00:19.120
<b>She can definitely hear you.</b>

00:00:17.050 --> 00:00:19.120
<b>She can definitely hear you.</b>

00:00:21.580 --> 00:00:27.540
<b><i>Back then, Mom was still alive, and Dad was kind—back then.</i></b>

00:00:28.770 --> 00:00:30.170
<b>Say, Kyou-chan…</b>

00:00:28.770 --> 00:00:30.170
<b>Say, Kyou-chan…</b>

00:00:31.170 --> 00:00:32.470
<b>What is it?</b>

00:00:31.170 --> 00:00:32.470
<b>What is it?</b>

00:00:32.470 --> 00:00:34.050
<b>I have a favor to ask of you.{long}</b>

00:00:32.470 --> 00:00:34.050
<b>I have a favor to ask of you.{long}</b>

00:00:34.960 --> 00:00:38.400
<b><i>Back then, I made a promise to Mom.</i></b>

00:00:38.960 --> 00:00:41.120
<b><i>A very important promise.</i></b>

00:00:41.520 --> 00:00:44.020
<b>Onee-chan! Onee-chan!</b>

00:00:44.930 --> 00:00:46.230
<b>Are you okay?</b>

00:00:48.580 --> 00:00:50.730
<b>Oh, I’m fine.</b>

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:54.200
<b>I wonder if your fever is gone yet.</b>

00:00:56.620 --> 00:00:58.310
<b>I’m fine!</b>

00:00:58.730 --> 00:01:01.660
<b>My temperature is the same as yours, so that means it’s gone!{FORESHADOWING}</b>

00:01:02.800 --> 00:01:04.460
<b>I’m going to go deliver newspapers.</b>

00:01:04.460 --> 00:01:05.900
<b>O-Onee-chan!</b>

00:01:06.330 --> 00:01:08.130
<b>Leave it to me!</b>

00:01:08.760 --> 00:01:11.260
<b>Onee-chan, don’t go out there.{you can’t}</b>

00:01:11.920 --> 00:01:13.590
<b>You can’t.</b>

00:01:13.590 --> 00:01:18.340
<b>Because you went on your newspaper run during rainy days, your cold got even worse.</b>

00:01:18.620 --> 00:01:22.180
<b>Don’t worry! It’s all about mind over matter!{病は気から 【やまいはきから】 (exp) sickness and health start with the mind}</b>

00:01:22.440 --> 00:01:25.520
<b>Onee-chan, you should really stay in bed!{blarg}</b>

00:01:36.280 --> 00:01:40.040
<b>Mom went to heaven the year Asu was born.</b>

00:01:40.510 --> 00:01:43.720
<b>Dad disappeared after accumulating gambling debts.{usage of "accumulate" in this sentence is still somewhat lulzy}</b>

00:01:44.340 --> 00:01:47.580
<b>Thus, we were abandoned.</b>

00:01:48.650 --> 00:01:52.480
<b>This is a 40-year-old, one-room,
dilapidated apartment with no bath.</b>

00:01:52.840 --> 00:01:55.190
<b>This is our home.</b>

00:01:55.190 --> 00:01:57.580
