<b>Oh yeah, I wonder if Asu would like to eat an apple.</b>

00:10:26.030 --> 00:10:28.700
<b>I really can’t do anything.</b>

00:10:29.600 --> 00:10:32.770
<b>When Asu isn’t here, I can’t do anything!{SO CRY ABOUT IT WHY DON’T YOU… oh, wait…}</b>

00:10:33.770 --> 00:10:37.990
<b>Mom, I can’t protect Asu like this!</b>

00:10:38.310 --> 00:10:40.020
<b>There’s just no way!</b>

00:10:51.980 --> 00:10:59.970
Hunger is the world's
best flavor enhancer.

00:10:51.980 --> 00:10:59.970
<b>If we wait just a little longer,
it'll taste so much more delicious...</b>

00:10:59.970 --> 00:11:08.480
Time, turn back! The food has
passed its expiration date!

00:11:20.570 --> 00:11:22.700
<b>Onee-chan, good morning!</b>

00:11:22.700 --> 00:11:23.980
<b>Good morning, Asu.</b>

00:11:24.340 --> 00:11:25.600
<b>How are you feeling?</b>

00:11:26.220 --> 00:11:27.970
<b>Is it okay that you’re already up?</b>

00:11:27.970 --> 00:11:29.630
<b>I’m feeling a lot better than I did yesterday.</b>

00:11:29.630 --> 00:11:30.790
<b>That’s great.</b>

00:11:30.790 --> 00:11:32.180
<b>Ah, that’s right.</b>

00:11:33.130 --> 00:11:35.020
<b>I peeled an apple for you.</b>

00:11:35.020 --> 00:11:36.360
<b>You did?</b>

00:11:40.070 --> 00:11:43.700
<b>Onee-chan, you didn’t soak them in salt water first, did you?{hurf, there do appear to be multiple apples here… I’m just gonna assume those are pieces.}</b>

00:11:44.430 --> 00:11:45.770
<b>Let’s eat!</b>

00:11:47.990 --> 00:11:49.170
<b>It’s tasty!</b>

00:11:51.300 --> 00:11:52.440
<b>I’m sorry.</b>

00:11:54.020 --> 00:11:55.160
<b>I’m sorry.</b>

00:11:55.750 --> 00:11:58.280
<b>I’m so {incapable}bad at everything…{hurf durf blurf}</b>

00:12:02.610 --> 00:12:03.610
<b>Onee-chan.</b>

00:12:04.230 --> 00:12:05.560
<b>How is she doing?{HMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMMM}</b>

00:12:05.560 --> 00:12:06.920
<b>Ah, Mr. Landlord.</b>

00:12:06.920 --> 00:12:08.540
<b>Good morning!</b>

00:12:08.540 --> 00:12:10.450
<b>I’m feeling a lot better.</b>

00:12:10.450 --> 00:12:13.020
<b>Thank you very much for yesterday.</b>

00:12:13.020 --> 00:12:15.580
<b>Leave the rest to me and get back to school.</b>

00:12:15.580 --> 00:12:17.830
<b>Oh… Okay.</b>

00:12:24.900 --> 00:12:27.100
<b>Onee-chan, take care.</b>

00:12:29.350 --> 00:12:30.670
<b>I’ll be going, then.</b>

00:12:38.750 --> 00:12:41.690
<b><i>Kyou-chan, please protect your sister.</i></b>

00:12:42.910 --> 00:12:44.690
<b>Okay! I’ll protect her!{dickfucking niggers I can’t decide of this shit should be italicized or not… maybe I’ll just make the outline sepia toned or some shit :V}</b>

